<title>USA: IMCO sees Q3 EPS below estimate.</title>
<headline>IMCO sees Q3 EPS below estimate.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>IMCO Recycling Inc said Friday it expects third quarter earnings of $0.16 to $0.18 a share, below a First Call consensus estimate of $0.25.</p>
<p>It cited lower-than-expected volumes and depressed industry conditions.  </p>
<p>An IMCO executive said overall volume in the quarter was below expectations, due in part to depressed market conditions.</p>
<p>It cited high inventories and low London Metal Exchange prices.</p>
<p>The company reported earnings of $0.27 a share for the third quarter of 1995.</p>
</text>
